    <h2>How these walkthroughs are made<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <p>Every walkthrough here is rebuilt from a real playthrough video, frame by frame: we extract the tap sequence, re-read it at least twice, and only publish steps that survive the double-check. When a level has steps we could only confirm once, the page says so. No invented answers, no hint-item spam.</p>

    <h2>FAQ<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
   
    <details><summary>What is Brain Puzzle 3: Crazy Mind?</summary><p>Brain Puzzle 3: Crazy Mind is a free-to-play brain teaser game by Joygame with story-driven trick levels: each level is a short scene where you tap, drag or expose the right thing to solve a mini puzzle. It is the third game in the Brain Puzzle series after Tricky Quest and Logic Twist.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How many levels does Brain Puzzle 3 have?</summary><p>Brain Puzzle 3 launched with well over a hundred story levels and keeps adding more through updates. This guide covers the levels players search for most, and we keep adding new walkthroughs as we clear them.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Is Brain Puzzle 3 free?</summary><p>Yes, Brain Puzzle 3 is free to download and play on iOS and Android. It is ad-supported: you can watch ads for hints if you get stuck, though every walkthrough on this page lets you clear levels without spending a hint.</p></details>

